{
  "_notes": [
    "Batman: The Dark Knight 2.90/2.94 Stern SAM revisions.",
    "Live headless PinMAME exercise verified Player 1 at 0x021109F0 and Player 2 at 0x021109F8 after a four-player start and simulated drain. Player 3/4 follow the confirmed eight-byte Stern SAM layout.",
    "SAM stores the 4 player scores as 4 x 8-byte (64-bit little-endian) fields: stride 8, not 4. The prior stride-4/length-4 layout mis-read players 2-4 (P2 read the zero high-bytes of P1, etc.). Corrected and validated against real 2-/3-/4-player Metallica dumps (mtl_180h)."
  ],
  "_fileformat": 0.7,
